  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e08-scene-10",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "手上的针眼  (IV Needle Marks and Quiet Company)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Noticing the row of IV needle marks on Chun Yuqiao's hand, Bu Xiaogu shares a childhood memory of being hospitalised alone and decides to keep him company a little longer. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你手上这一串针眼，挺疼吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这有什么疼呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我小时候得过肺炎，得住好多天院。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我就觉得我整个胳膊每天都是凉的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "心也特凉，再加上没有人陪，感觉特别凄凉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那以后就别再得肺炎了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我和杏子姐还有凯文哥，也会一直努力让你少得胃病。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你是第一个来看我，没有让我爱惜自己身体的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实我刚想提醒你爱惜自己身体，好险！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有事就先回去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没什么事，真的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我走了？要不我再陪你多待一会儿。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你手上这一串针眼，挺疼吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That row of needle marks on your hand must hurt quite a bit, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这有什么疼呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is painful about that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我小时候得过肺炎，得住好多天院。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When I was little I caught pneumonia and had to stay in hospital for days.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我就觉得我整个胳膊每天都是凉的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I felt as if my whole arm was icy cold every single day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "心也特凉，再加上没有人陪，感觉特别凄凉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My heart felt cold too, and with nobody there beside me, it felt terribly lonely.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那以后就别再得肺炎了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then make sure you never catch pneumonia again.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我和杏子姐还有凯文哥，也会一直努力让你少得胃病。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sister Xingzi, Brother Kaiwen, and I will keep working hard so your stomach flares up less often.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你是第一个来看我，没有让我爱惜自己身体的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are the first visitor who did not lecture me to take better care of my health.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实我刚想提醒你爱惜自己身体，好险！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Actually I was just about to remind you to take care of your health—close call!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有事就先回去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you have work waiting, head on back first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没什么事，真的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nothing urgent at all, really.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我走了？要不我再陪你多待一会儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Shall I head off then? Or maybe I will stay and keep you company a little longer.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你手上这一串针眼，挺疼吧？",
      "gap": 0.5
