      "t": "有事就先回去吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没什么事，真的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我走了？要不我再陪你多待一会儿。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Instead of rushing out the door, Bu Xiaogu pulls up a chair so Chun Yuqiao does not have to sit through his drip alone. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
